## Verification Plan

### Automated Benchmark Tests
- Run `scratch/test_pipelined_stream.py` directly using Python 3.11 venv to measure:
  - Time-to-First-Token (TTFT)
  - Time-to-First-Sentence (TTFS)
  - Time-to-First-Audio (TTFA)
- Run unit tests on `find_sentence_boundary` covering edge cases (`Dr.`, `3.14`, `\n\n`, `!`, `?`).

### End-to-End Build & Interface Verification
- Run `npm run build` in `frontend/` to confirm zero lint/syntax errors.
- Query test: Send a multi-sentence prompt (e.g. *"Explain why planets orbit stars in three sentences"*).
  - Verify audio starts speaking the first sentence within ~1-1.5 seconds.
  - Verify sentence 2 and 3 play consecutively without clipping or gaps.
  - Verify 3D bust emissive pulsing continues seamlessly across sentence chunks.
  - Verify open palm gesture instantly cancels audio playback and clears the queue.
